1. If the counter logic changes to count higher than 3, it will overflow silently
2. The comparison with 3 (binary 11) works but is fragile
3. The +1 increment when cnt=3 would cause an overflow (though Verilog would wrap it around)

The code remains syntactically valid and compilable, but contains this potential issue that could cause problems if the design evolves.
