- A=3'b101, B=3'b011 → A_greater=1 (since 01 > 11 is false, 01 == 11 is false, 01 < 11 is true)
- A=3'b010, B=3'b110 → A_equal=1 (since 10 == 10)
- A=3'b000, B=3'b100 → A_less=1 (since 00 < 00 is false, 00 == 00 is true)

The module should be purely combinational with no clock input.
