   - When minutes reach 60 (only possible when seconds are at 59), they should wrap to 0 and hours should increment by 1
   - When hours reach 24 (only possible when both minutes and seconds are at 59), they should wrap to 0

All outputs should maintain their values until the next relevant clock edge. The module should properly handle all wrap-around conditions between time units.
QUESTION END
