- Inputs: 
  a[7:0], b[7:0]: 8-bit operands
  cin: carry-in bit
- Outputs:
  sum[7:0]: 8-bit sum
  cout: carry-out bit

The dut_dependency_2 module is provided and implements a standard full adder with inputs a, b, cin and outputs sum, cout. You must instantiate this module for each bit position.

Note: The solution must exactly match the specified carry propagation pattern - any deviation will be considered incorrect.
QUESTION END
