   - When minimum is reached, transition back to the first state
3. The wave should continuously oscillate between 0 and 31 (inclusive) in this triangular pattern.

Timing Requirements:
- All state transitions and output changes must occur synchronously on the rising clock edge
- The reset should take effect asynchronously

Assume all inputs are glitch-free and meet setup/hold times.
