Design a 32-bit arithmetic logic unit (ALU) that performs various arithmetic and logical operations based on a 6-bit control signal. The ALU should support both signed and unsigned operations with appropriate status flag generation.

Inputs:
- a, b: 32-bit operands
- aluc: 6-bit operation code specifying the ALU operation

