- r: 32-bit result of the operation
- zero: 1 if result is zero, 0 otherwise
- carry: Carry-out bit (for arithmetic operations)
- negative: 1 if result is negative (MSB set), 0 otherwise
- overflow: 1 if arithmetic overflow occurs, 0 otherwise
- flag: Special comparison flag for SLT/SLTU operations, high-Z otherwise

