- Sum[3:0]: Corrected 4-bit BCD sum
- Cout: Carry-out bit (1 when sum exceeds single BCD digit)

Note: Invalid BCD inputs (values 10-15) may occur, but the module must still produce correct BCD outputs for the sum of the inputs.
QUESTION END
