   - If the counter reaches 11 (4'b1011), it should wrap around to 0 on the next increment
   - If valid_count is low, maintain the current counter value
3. All state changes must occur synchronously with the clock edge except for reset

The module should maintain its count value indefinitely according to these rules. Assume all inputs are glitch-free and meet setup/hold times.
QUESTION END
