Assume:
- NUM_DIV is an even positive integer parameter
- The internal counter should be just wide enough to count up to NUM_DIV/2
- All transitions should occur on the positive edge of the input clock

Write a Verilog module that implements this clock divider with the specified interface and behavior.
QUESTION END
