5. All operations should be synchronous to the rising edge of clk
6. Reset should clear all internal state and outputs

Timing Requirements:
- The sum should be available in the same cycle that valid_out is asserted
- The module should be ready to accept new inputs immediately after valid_out is asserted
- Inputs should only be processed when valid_in is high
QUESTION END
