   - Pulse valid_out high for one clock cycle
   - Reset the accumulation for the next group of 4 inputs
3. The module should handle back-to-back input sequences without dropping data
4. All outputs should be registered and change only on rising clock edges
5. Asynchronous reset should clear all internal state and outputs

Timing Requirements:
- The accumulation counter must reset after every 4 valid inputs
- valid_out must only be high for one clock cycle when the sum is ready
- The module must be ready to accept new inputs immediately after outputting a sum

Assume the input data rate may be intermittent (not necessarily every cycle).
QUESTION END
