Reset -> out = 00000001
1st cycle -> out = 00000010
2nd cycle -> out = 00000100
...
7th cycle -> out = 10000000
8th cycle -> out = 00000001 (wraps around)

The module should be purely synchronous to the positive clock edge. Do not use any asynchronous logic except for the reset signal.
QUESTION END
