The module should be combinational (output changes immediately when inputs change) and handle the parameterized bit widths Q and N (with Q ≤ N). Assume N is at least 2 bits wide.

Note: The magnitude comparison and arithmetic operations should only consider the magnitude bits (all bits except the MSB sign bit).
QUESTION END
