   - Otherwise, implement a two-stage synchronizer for the data_en signal from clk_a to clk_b domain
   - Update dataout with data_in only when the synchronized enable signal is active (after two clk_b cycles)

Timing:
- All resets should be asynchronous and active-low
- Data transfers between clock domains must be properly synchronized
- Output should only update when the enable signal is valid in clk_b domain

Assume both clock domains are asynchronous to each other and have no known phase relationship.
QUESTION END
