6. State transitions occur when countdown reaches 3 (allowing 3s warning before change)
7. Transition sequence: red → green → yellow → red (looping)

Timing Requirements:
- All outputs must be registered
- State transitions must occur on clock edges
- Output signals must be mutually exclusive (only one light active at a time)

Assume all inputs are synchronized to the clock domain.
QUESTION END
