4. All outputs should be zero when rst_n is low or when no valid operation is in progress
5. The multiplier should maintain zero outputs when mul_en_in is low

Assume all signals are synchronous to the rising edge of clk. The module should be parameterized for 8-bit inputs (default) but should be easily adaptable to other sizes.
